# ADR-0484 decision 4: the 5.4 LOGON flow. The HELLO carries no auth
# fields — user_agent plus the mandatory bolt_agent map alone (decision 3)
# — and answers SUCCESS without opening a session; LOGON with the
# configured basic credential opens it (SUCCESS {}); RUN and PULL then
# serve a result; GOODBYE closes. The server runs with a preset
# credential, so the basic scheme is really checked.
!: BOLT 5.4
!: SERVER_ARGS --uri :memory: --auth relate:compat-pass
!: AUTO HELLO
!: AUTO GOODBYE

C: LOGON {"scheme": "basic", "principal": "relate", "credentials": "compat-pass"}
S: SUCCESS {}
C: RUN "RETURN 1 AS n" {} {}
   PULL {"n": -1}
S: SUCCESS {"fields": ["n"]}
   RECORD [1]
   SUCCESS {}
